Codec names from CPython
------------------------

src/lib/codecs.js lists, in PY_CODEC_ALIASES, the codec names CPython's
encodings package resolves (encodings.aliases and its modules), under
CPython's license (https://github.com/python/cpython): the Python Software
Foundation License Version 2 (the PSF License) and the older licenses of
CPython's license stack, in LICENSE-PYTHON (CPython 3.14.0's LICENSE file,
